From 91aaa46fd765823ed416beeccf7b94d80d794497 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: grubbychicken <ben@grbychkn.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 12:35:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ML4 decode attention: head-batched scores and context over
 the FP16 latent row (ml4-decode.cuh: a key is loaded once for 16 / 4 heads,
 not once per head; same bits as the generic kernels, GR8_ATTN_HEADS=0 =
 those); GR8_DEC_PROF stages inside the CP block. 4-row verify 98.6 -> 91.0 ms
 short, 169.5 -> 118.1 ms at 28K

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
