 engine/attn/decode-small.cuh | 15 ++++++---
 engine/attn/ml4-decode.cuh   | 62 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 engine/runtime/rank.cuh      |  8 +++++
 4 files changed, 85 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 engine/attn/ml4-decode.cuh

